            %p
          %p
            In
            %a{:href => "#SchrijversPirógWuJaskelioff19"} Schrijvers, Piróg, Wu &amp; Jaskelioff 2019 p. 99
            the analogous condition is stated in terms of the join-operation. We may check that these are equivalent:
          %p
          #EquivalenceOfDefinitions.num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              A system of transformations
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
