            %p
              Going diagonally through this
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commuting+diagram"} commuting diagram
              and using
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:BindFromJoin"} (5)
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:RespectForBindOperation"} (3)
              and the total top and right composite is the right hand side of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:RespectForBindOperation"} (3)
            %p
              In the other direction, if
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:RespectForBindOperation"} (3)
              holds then its restriction to the case
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
